    "## 1. 事件流基础 —— Server-Sent Events (SSE)\n",
    "\n",
    "**SSE 是什么**：一种**服务器主动推送**的协议，基于 HTTP，单向（客户端 → 服务器 request，服务器 → 客户端 stream）。\n",
    "\n",
    "**关键特性**：\n",
    "- 基于 HTTP，天然支持 WebSocket 的优点（低延迟）\n",
    "- 每行以 `data: ` 开头，以 `\\n\\n` 分隔\n",
    "- 自动重连、带类型\n",
    "- 浏览器原生支持 EventSource API\n",
    "\n",
    "**Python 实现**：逐行读取 + 字符串解析"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s1-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "class SSEStream:\n",
    "    '''简单的 SSE 事件流实现，用于生成器输出'''\n",
    "    def __init__(self, event_type: str = 'message'):\n",
    "        self.event_type = event_type\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def format_event(self, data: str) -> str:\n",
    "        return f\"data: {data}\\n\\n\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def format(self, data: str) -> bytes:\n",
    "        return self.format_event(data).encode('utf-8')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 示例：生成 SSE 流\n",
    "async def demo_sse_stream() -> AsyncIterator[str]:\n",
    "    stream = SSEStream(event_type='response')\n",
    "    chunks = ['我是助手。', '基于', '上下文', '回答。', '\\n']\n",
    "    for chunk in chunks:\n",
    "        await asyncio.sleep(0.1)  # 模拟延迟\n",
    "        yield stream.format(chunk)\n",
    "\n",
    "async def consume_sse() -> list[str]:\n",
    "    events = []\n",
    "    async for chunk in demo_sse_stream():\n",
    "        events.append(chunk.decode('utf-8'))\n",
    "    return events\n",
    "\n",
    "events = asyncio.run(consume_sse())\n",
    "print(''.join(events))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s2-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. FastAPI 异步处理 —— async / await 生态\n",
    "\n",
    "**FastAPI 的 async 优势**：\n",
    "- 基于 Starlette，全异步 I/O\n",
    "- 每个请求独占一个 worker，不阻塞\n",
    "- 可以轻松调用异步 LLM / 向量库\n",
    "\n",
    "**核心概念**：\n",
    "- `async def handler()`：定义异步函数\n",
    "- `await future`：等待异步操作完成（LLM / 网络调用）\n",
    "- 返回 `StreamingResponse`：用于流式输出"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s2-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from fastapi import FastAPI\n",
    "from fastapi.responses import StreamingResponse\n",
    "\n",
    "app = FastAPI(title='RAG SSE Demo')\n",
    "\n",
    "# SSE 端点\n",
    "async def sse_generator(question: str):\n",
    "    stream = SSEStream(event_type='rag_answer')\n",
    "    # 1. 返回 context\n",
    "    yield stream.format(json.dumps({'type': 'context', 'contexts': ['context A', 'context B']}))\n",
    "    # 2. 等待一下\n",
    "    await asyncio.sleep(0.2)\n",
    "    # 3. 返回 answer（流式）\n",
    "    async for chunk in chat_fn(f\"回答：{question}\", stream=True):\n",
    "        yield stream.format(json.dumps({'type': 'chunk', 'content': chunk}))\n",
    "    # 4. 完成\n",
    "    yield stream.format(json.dumps({'type': 'done'}))\n",
    "\n",
    "@app.post('/query/stream')\n",
    "async def query_stream(question: str):\n",
    "    return StreamingResponse(sse_generator(question), media_type='text/event-stream')"
   ]
  },
