    "## 4. Docker Compose 多服务编排\n",
    "\n",
    "**Docker Compose 的作用**：\n",
    "- 定义「多容器应用」的配置（RAG 服务 + 向量库 + LLM 服务）\n",
    "- 统一网络、卷、环境变量\n",
    "- 一键启动/停止/重启\n",
    "\n",
    "**典型服务**：\n",
    "- `rag-api`：FastAPI 服务\n",
    "- `chroma`：向量库（或 Qdrant / Milvus）\n",
    "- `ollama`：本地 LLM 服务（或远程 API）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s4-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# docker-compose.yml 内容示例（写入文件）\n",
    "docker_compose_content = '''\n",
    "version: '3.8'\n",
    "\n",
    "services:\n",
    "  rag-api:\n",
    "    build: ./rag-api\n",
    "    ports:\n",
    "      - \"8000:8000\"\n",
    "    environment:\n",
    "      - CHROMA_HOST=chroma\n",
    "      - OLLAMA_HOST=ollama:11434\n",
    "    depends_on:\n",
    "      - chroma\n",
    "      - ollama\n",
    "    volumes:\n",
    "      - ./data:/app/data\n",
    "    restart: unless-stopped\n",
    "\n",
    "  chroma:\n",
    "    image: chromadb/chroma:latest\n",
    "    ports:\n",
    "      - \"8001:8000\"\n",
    "    volumes:\n",
    "      - ./chroma-data:/chroma/chroma\n",
    "    restart: unless-stopped\n",
    "\n",
    "  ollama:\n",
    "    image: ollama/ollama:latest\n",
    "    ports:\n",
    "      - \"11434:11434\"\n",
    "    volumes:\n",
    "      - ./ollama-data:/root/.ollama\n",
    "    restart: unless-stopped\n",
    "'''\n",
    "\n",
    "# 写入 docker-compose.yml\n",
    "Path('docker-compose.yml').write_text(docker_compose_content)\n",
    "print('✅ docker-compose.yml 已生成')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s4-c2",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# docker-compose.yml 的关键点解释\n",
    "print('''Docker Compose 配置要点：\n",
    "\n",
    "1. services: 定义每个容器的配置\n",
    "   - build: Dockerfile 路径\n",
    "   - ports: 端口映射（主机:容器）\n",
    "   - environment: 环境变量（引用其他服务名）\n",
    "   - depends_on: 依赖关系（启动顺序）\n",
    "   - volumes: 持久化卷\n",
    "\n",
    "2. 网络自动创建：所有服务在同一个 docker network 中\n",
    "   - 拉起后可通过服务名互相访问：rag-api → chroma:8000\n",
    "\n",
    "3. 卷的作用：\n",
    "   - ./data:/app/data → 保存向量库数据\n",
    "   - ./chroma-data:/chroma/chroma → 保存 ChromaDB 持久化\n",
    "   - ./ollama-data:/root/.ollama → 保存模型权重\n",
    "\n",
    "4. restart 策略：\n",
    "   - unless-stopped：手动停止前一直运行\n",
    "   - always：总是重启\n",
    "   - no：不自动重启\n',
    "")"
   ]
  },
