    "## 5. RAG API Dockerfile —— 把 FastAPI 打包成镜像\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dockerfile 的作用**：\n",
    "- 确保运行环境一致（OS、依赖版本）\n",
    "- 减少本地安装负担（CI/CD 部署更方便）\n",
    "- 支持多阶段构建（减小镜像体积）\n",
    "\n",
    "**关键步骤**：\n",
    "1. 基础镜像（`python:3.11-slim`）\n",
    "2. 安装依赖（`requirements.txt`）\n",
    "3. 复制代码\n",
    "4. 暴露端口\n",
    "5. 启动命令"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s5-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Dockerfile 内容示例\n",
    "dockerfile_content = '''\n",
    "# 多阶段构建：构建阶段 + 运行阶段\n",
    "FROM python:3.11-slim as builder\n",
    "\n",
    "WORKDIR /app\n",
    "COPY requirements.txt .\n",
    "RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt\n",
    "\n",
    "# 运行阶段\n",
    "FROM python:3.11-slim\n",
    "\n",
    "WORKDIR /app\n",
    "COPY --from=builder /usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages /usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages\n",
    "COPY . .\n",
    "\n",
    "EXPOSE 8000\n",
    "\n",
    "# 使用 uvicorn 启动\n",
    "CMD [\"uvicorn\", \"main:app\", \"--host\", \"0.0.0.0\", \"--port\", \"8000\", \"--workers\", \"1\"]\n",
    "'''\n",
    "\n",
    "# 写入 Dockerfile\n",
    "Path('Dockerfile').write_text(dockerfile_content)\n",
    "print('✅ Dockerfile 已生成')"
   ]
  },
