    "## 6. 真实部署流程 —— 从代码到 Docker\n",
    "\n",
    "**完整流程**：\n",
    "1. 写好 `main.py`（FastAPI 入口）\n",
    "2. 写好 `Dockerfile`（打包）\n",
    "3. 写好 `docker-compose.yml`（编排）\n",
    "4. 在项目根目录运行：\n",
    "   ```bash\n",
    "   docker-compose up -d --build\n",
    "   ```\n",
    "5. 访问 `http://localhost:8000/docs` 查看 API 文档"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s6-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# main.py 内容示例（FastAPI 入口）\n",
    "main_py = '''\n",
    "from fastapi import FastAPI\n",
    "from fastapi.responses import StreamingResponse\n",
